    "name": "Replace one nested Cluster field",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "Replacing Config.Offset preserves the nested Name and outer Enabled fields. The selection uses persistent field identities, independently from their displayed names.\n\nReplacing Config.Offset preserves the nested Name and outer Enabled fields. The selection uses persistent field identities, independently from their displayed names.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: studio.native.composed@1.\nExpected:\noffset (i64) = -7\nname (string) = \"kept\"\nenabled (bool) = true\n",
